  "title": "Persona Steering and Incongruity Resolution in LLMs",
  "summary": "This study examines how persona conditioning in large language models (LLMs) can improve task-execution performance while addressing the inherent incongruity between human personas and AI representations. By integrating dual-stream refinement techniques, QuirkyMind enables more accurate and reliable persona steering, balancing performance gains with reliability risks.",
  "facts": [
