      "statement": "Empirical evaluations demonstrate that QuirkyMind mitigates drift and preserves authentic incongruities.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The framework uses dual-stream latent states to stabilize persona representation and improve task performance.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
